; Zone file for pocketprint3d.com - import into the Hetzner DNS zone (BIND format).
; Website on GitHub Pages: https://docs.github.com/pages/configuring-a-custom-domain-for-your-github-pages-site
; The domain is delegated to Hetzner konsoleH (ns1.your-server.de, ns.second-ns.com, ns3.second-ns.de):
; konsoleH -> pocketprint3d.com -> DNS -> edit the zone as text and paste the records below the NS lines.
$ORIGIN pocketprint3d.com.
$TTL 3600

@       IN  SOA   ns1.your-server.de. postmaster.your-server.de. (
                  2026093001 ; serial
                  86400      ; refresh
                  10800      ; retry
                  3600000    ; expire
                  3600 )     ; negative TTL

@       IN  NS    ns1.your-server.de.
@       IN  NS    ns.second-ns.com.
@       IN  NS    ns3.second-ns.de.

; --- GitHub Pages (apex domain) ---
@       IN  A     185.199.108.153
@       IN  A     185.199.109.153
@       IN  A     185.199.110.153
@       IN  A     185.199.111.153
@       IN  AAAA  2606:50c0:8000::153
@       IN  AAAA  2606:50c0:8001::153
@       IN  AAAA  2606:50c0:8002::153
@       IN  AAAA  2606:50c0:8003::153

; --- www -> GitHub Pages (redirects to pocketprint3d.com) ---
www     IN  CNAME halvar20000.github.io.

; --- No e-mail on this domain yet: stop others from sending mail in its name ---
; Remove these three records when you set up e-mail (e.g. kontakt@pocketprint3d.com)
; and add the MX/SPF records of your mail provider instead.
@       IN  MX    0 .
@       IN  TXT   "v=spf1 -all"
_dmarc  IN  TXT   "v=DMARC1; p=reject; sp=reject; adkim=s; aspf=s"
